//! The Civilization Engine's boundary and save schemas.
//!
//! - [`wire`]: payloads of `commons-wire` frames ([ADR-0001]). The frame kind decides the root
//!   table (see `schema/tce_wire.fbs`).
//! - [`save`]: payloads of `commons-persist` sections ([ADR-0002]).
//!
//! Both are generated by flatc 25.12.19 from `schema/*.fbs` into `src/generated/`. Never edit the
//! generated files; change the schema and run `tools/gen-schema.sh`. CI checks they match.
//!
//! [ADR-0001]: ../../../../decisions/0001-boundary-schema.md
//! [ADR-0002]: ../../../../decisions/0002-snapshot-container.md

#[allow(
    unsafe_code,
    unused_imports,
    dead_code,
    deprecated,
    non_camel_case_types,
    non_snake_case,
    missing_debug_implementations,
    mismatched_lifetime_syntaxes,
    clippy::all,
    clippy::pedantic,
    clippy::unwrap_used
)]
